      "content": "The feeling that your core self is gone is an agonizing, existential wound, and it is more than just a \"slump.\" If you are feeling that you are an \"inconvenience,\" please reach out to emergency mental health services immediately, even if it feels overwhelming to do so. A crisis professional can help you address the immediate danger and help you find a way to exist, even if you don't feel that way right now.",
